rs, offers a range of 1 BHK and 2 BHK apartments, with carpet areas spanning from 427 to 678 sqft. The development boasts an array of modern amenities, including CCTV/video surveillance, a well-equipped gymnasium, a serene yoga area, and the convenience of an intercom facility. With Jet Build Developers at the helm, Shiv Tapasya promises a harmonious blend of comfort and convenience, making it the ideal place to call home in the bustling city of Mumbai.\n\nConfiguration\n\n1 BHK, 2 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Jun 2024\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹22,600/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n427 - 678 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Expect improved connectivity with the upcoming metro line 2.\n* Known for tourist attractions such as Essel World, Mandapeshwar Caves, Fish Park, and Global Vipassana Pagoda.\n* Amenities include landscaping, tree planting, meter room, water conservation, rainwater harvesting, stormwater drains, solid waste management, fire protection, 100% power backup, and 100% vaastu-compliant apartments.\n\n* Strong social infrastructure with various malls and retail hubs.\n* Several schools in the area, including Himalayan High School, Mumbai World School, and SPS Suvidyalaya.\n* Accessibility to key landmarks and proximity to medical facilities.\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/cctv-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-secondary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/Intercom-Facility-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Intercom-Facility-secondary.svg)\n\nIntercom Facility\n\n![amenities/yoga-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/yoga-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nYoga Area\n\n![amenities/cctv-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-primary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/gym-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-primary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/Intercom-Facility-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Intercom-Facility-primary.svg)\n\nIn