etbuild Developers Shiv Tapasya Project\n\n📍 Borivali West, Mumbai Suburban · 400092\n\nCertificate Signed\n\n**Completed/historical project — current inventory unconfirmed**\n\nAsk an advisor to check current resale or rental availability.\n\nSource stage: Sold Out · mapped resale: 0 · mapped rental: 0 · primary status: recorded\n\ni\n\n## Overview\n\nShiv Tapasya by Jet Build Developers in Borivali West offers premium 1 and 2 BHK apartments designed for a blissful and wholesome lifestyle. Enjoy seamless connectivity with nearby W.E. Highway, upcoming metro, Link Road, and S.V. Road, plus easy access to education, entertainment, wellness, and spiritual centers within 2.5 km. With modern amenities like a fitness center, meditation space, high-speed elevators, and secure parking, Shiv Tapasya combines luxury and comfort for a peaceful, happy living experience.\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹40,000**\n\n23% below avg\n\n₹\n\n## Borivali West — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹31,200/sqft\n\nmedian · 29 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹88.7/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹60,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.4%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nThis project is quoted around **₹30,681/sqft** — **2% below** resale here.\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nJun 2024\n\nStatus\n\nNew\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price\n\n1 BHK Society Member426 ft²₹1.31 Cr\n\n1 BHK320–426 ft²₹98 L–₹1.31 Cr\n\n1 BHK Mcgm426 ft²₹1.31 Cr\n\n2 BHK Mcgm544 ft²₹1.67 Cr\n\n2 BHK Society Member521–606 ft²₹1.6 Cr–₹1.86 Cr\n\n2 BHK544–678 ft²₹1.67 Cr–₹2.08 Cr\n\n3 BHK Society Member678 ft²₹2.08 Cr\n\n3 BHK783–892 ft²₹2.4 Cr–₹2.74 Cr\n\nShop320–892 ft²₹98 L–₹2.74 Cr\n\nConfigurations & carpet per MahaRERA filing · indicative price = locality rate × carpet (not the developer's quote).\n\n[💬 Verify current inventory with an advisor](https://wa.me/919820067